#: seo.php:31
msgid "Frontend address"
msgstr "Indirizzo del frontend"

#: seo.php:32
msgid "The address of the headless site, like https://www.example.com. In GraphQL the links of the Barrio Suite SEO (canonical, JSON-LD, llms.txt) point there instead of WordPress; images stay on WordPress."
