#. Description of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php
msgid "The Barrio Suite forms, SEO, popups, banners, opening hours and company details in WPGraphQL, for headless frontends."
msgstr "I form, il SEO, i popup, i banner, gli orari e i dati aziendali di Barrio Suite in WPGraphQL, per i frontend headless."
